<title>USA: New York physical copper market.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for February shipment were quoted at a nominal 110.90 to 111.15 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 88.50 cents, up 1.50 cents from February 12th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
